Promotion & Bonus System – Functional Documentation

1. Overview

The Promotion System lets the platform create, manage, display, activate, and redeem multiple campaigns (e.g., New Member Bonus, Slot Deposit Bonus, Cashback). Admin defines everything; the user site reflects changes instantly.

⸻

2. User Functionality

2.1 Promotion Display
	•	Header/homepage banner lists all currently active promotions.
	•	Each card shows: image, title, status (Active/Expired), optional expiry.

2.2 User Actions
	•	Activate / Claim: enabled only when eligibility is met; otherwise disabled or shows “Does Not Meet Requirements”. On click, user goes to the Promotion Details page and status becomes Activated.
	•	View Details: opens Promotion Details (modal or page) with full description, T&C, calculation examples, turnover (TO) rules, and validity period.

2.3 Promotion Details (Bonus Inner Page)
	•	Shows title, validity window, bonus type, eligible games, min deposit, max bonus, turnover multiplier (e.g., 22x deposit + bonus).

2.4 Progress & Redemption
	•	After activation, show progress: current TO, required TO, completion%.
	•	Example: Deposit 100,000 + Bonus 100,000 → TO = (Deposit + Bonus) x 22 = 4,400,000.
	•	Redeem / Claim button appears when TO is fully met; on success, bonus moves to main wallet and status becomes Completed.
	•	If rules are violated, bonus can be forfeited automatically; reason is visible in admin.

2.5 User-Side Rules Enforcement
	•	Common rules: new members only, specific games/providers, max claims per user, bonus validity after activation, anti-abuse (multi-account, stacking prevention, non-stackable with other promos when flagged).

⸻

3. Admin Functionality

3.1 Promotion Management
	•	Create, edit, enable/disable, delete promotions.

3.2 Configuration Fields
	•	Basic: title, description (rich text/HTML), image/banner, type (deposit bonus, cashback, free spin, etc.), status.
	•	Bonus: percentage, minimum deposit, maximum bonus, turnover multiplier, eligible games/providers.
	•	Eligibility: new user only flag, user level/VIP tier, one-time vs multiple claims, stackable toggle.
	•	Validity: start/end date-time, bonus expiry duration after activation.

3.3 Monitoring & Controls
	•	Dashboard lists users who activated, met turnover, redeemed, or were forfeited; shows per-user progress.
	•	Admin can forfeit/cancel manually.
	•	Audit logs: activation, turnover updates, redemption, forfeits.

⸻

4. System Flow
	1.	Admin creates/publishes a promotion.
	2.	User site shows it in the header/banner list.
	3.	User opens details to read T&C.
	4.	User activates; promotion moves to the user’s Bonus page.
	5.	User plays eligible games; system tracks turnover automatically.
	6.	When TO met, user redeems bonus.
	7.	Bonus credits to main wallet; status becomes Completed (or forfeited if rules broken).

