5. Bonus Types

5.1 New Member Bonus (Slots Deposit)
	•	Validity: until 02-Mar-2026.
	•	Eligible users: new members only; slots games only.
	•	Deposit limits: minimum deposit IDR 100,000; maximum bonus IDR 500,000.
	•	Bonus formula: Bonus = min(Deposit x (Configured %), IDR 500,000).
	•	Turnover formula: Required TO = (Deposit + Bonus) x 22. Example: Deposit 100,000 → Bonus 100,000 → TO requirement 4,400,000.
	•	Claim flow: go to "Claim Bonus" page, select the promo, click "Claim this promotion".
	•	Redemption timing: bonus can be claimed after TO is met; must be claimed within 24 hours of meeting TO or it is forfeited.
	•	Restrictions: anti-abuse checks (e.g., pending free spins) may freeze balance; shared IP cannot withdraw; not eligible for weekly bonus while on this promo; general T&C apply and operator may cancel/withdraw without notice.

5.2 Casino Streak Bonus (Live Casino)
	•	Scope: all members; live casino Baccarat only.
	•	Eligibility pattern: 8 consecutive tickets that are all wins or all losses within one day (00:00–23:59).
	•	Stake example: ticket stake IDR 50,000; 8 tickets → total stake 400,000.
	•	Bonus formula: Bonus = Total valid stake x Configured %. Example: 400,000 x 25% = 100,000.
	•	Betting freeze: must stop betting after the 8th ticket when claiming; any bet before crediting voids the bonus.
	•	Claim flow: send ticket numbers and win/lose ticket photos to CS; wait for verification.
	•	Category choice: may choose both “Win streak” and “Lose streak” once per day each.
	•	Validity: can be claimed daily during promo period; 8-ticket streak validity is per day (00:00–23:59).
	•	Exclusions: ties/draws/side bets are not valid tickets.
	•	Anti-abuse: fraud, bonus hunting, shared IP can void bonus and winnings; operator may change/cancel without notice.
	•	Additional note: different minimum stakes (e.g., 20,000 vs 300,000) change max bonus and the 20-ticket prize tier (e.g., Honda CBR or Daihatsu Ayla).

5.3 Slots Cashback + Commission
	•	Validity: until 24-Sep-2030 (promo started 18-May-2020).
	•	Scope: all members using IDR; slots games only.
	•	Calculation window: weekly Monday–Sunday; bonuses credited every Monday of the following week.
	•	Rates: Cashback 5% on net loss after commission; Commission 0.5% on weekly turnover.
	•	Formulas:
		•	Commission = Weekly Turnover x 0.5%.
		•	Cashback Base = max(Weekly Net Loss – Commission, 0).
		•	Cashback = Cashback Base x 5%.
		•	Total Bonus = Commission + Cashback.
	•	Example (as provided): Weekly net loss 100,000; weekly turnover 1,000,000 → Commission 1,000,000 x 0.5% = 5,000; Cashback Base = 100,000 – 5,000 = 95,000; Cashback = 95,000 x 5% = 4,750; Total Bonus = 4,750 + 5,000 = 9,750.
	•	Claim flow: open “Claim Commission” page, select this promo, click “Claim this promotion.”
	•	Restrictions: identical IP or incorrect member data voids bonus; turnover manipulation/abuse voids bonus and winnings; general T&C apply.

5.4 Sports Cashback + Commission
