	•	Scope: all new members using IDR; sportsbook only.
	•	Calculation window: weekly Monday–Sunday; bonuses credited every Monday of the following week.
	•	Rates: Cashback 5% on net loss after commission; Commission 0.5% on qualifying weekly turnover.
	•	Formulas:
		•	Commission = Qualifying Weekly Turnover x 0.5%.
		•	Cashback Base = max(Weekly Net Loss – Commission, 0).
		•	Cashback = Cashback Base x 5%.
		•	Total Bonus = Commission + Cashback (minimum payout 10,000).
	•	Example: Weekly net loss 200,000; qualifying turnover 2,000,000 → Commission 2,000,000 x 0.5% = 10,000; Cashback Base = 200,000 – 10,000 = 190,000; Cashback = 190,000 x 5% = 9,500; Total Bonus = 10,000 + 9,500 = 19,500.
	•	Odds threshold for valid turnover: DEC ≥ 1.7; HK/CN ≥ 0.7; IND ≥ -1.43; MY ≥ 0.7; US ≥ -143. Lower odds bets are excluded from turnover.
	•	Exclusions: opposite/safety bets or other sports void bonus and winning bets; identical IP or incorrect member data voids bonus; turnover manipulation/abuse voids bonus and winnings; general T&C apply.
	•	Claim flow: open “Claim Commission” page, select this promo, click “Claim this promotion.”

