6. Admin Inputs & Formulas (per bonus type)

6.1 New Member 100% (Slots Deposit)
	•	Admin inputs: min_deposit; max_bonus; bonus_percentage; to_multiplier (22x); expiry_after_activation_hours; allowed_games (slots); eligibility flag (new member only).
	•	Formulas: Bonus = min(deposit x bonus_percentage, max_bonus). Required TO = (deposit + bonus) x to_multiplier.

6.2 Casino Streak Bonus (Live Casino)
	•	Admin inputs: streak_length (8); bonus_percentage (25%); stake_min; stake_max (optional); day_window (00:00–23:59); allowed_game (baccarat).
	•	Formulas: detect 8 consecutive win-only or loss-only tickets; Total Stake = sum(ticket stakes in streak); Bonus = Total Stake x bonus_percentage.

6.3 Slots Cashback + Commission
	•	Admin inputs: cashback_percentage (5%); commission_percentage (0.5%); min_payout (optional); calc_window (Mon–Sun); payout_day (Mon); scope (slots).
	•	Formulas: Commission = Weekly Turnover x commission_percentage. CashbackBase = max(Weekly Net Loss – Commission, 0). Cashback = CashbackBase x cashback_percentage. Total Bonus = Commission + Cashback.

6.4 Sports Cashback + Commission
	•	Admin inputs: cashback_percentage (5%); commission_percentage (0.5%); min_payout (10,000); odds_thresholds (DEC≥1.7, HK/CN≥0.7, IND≥-1.43, MY≥0.7, US≥-143); calc_window (Mon–Sun); payout_day (Mon); scope (sportsbook); eligibility flag (new member only).
	•	Formulas: Commission = Qualifying Turnover x commission_percentage. CashbackBase = max(Weekly Net Loss – Commission, 0). Cashback = CashbackBase x cashback_percentage. Total Bonus = Commission + Cashback.

6.5 Poker Weekly Rakeback
	•	Admin inputs: rakeback_percentage (0.3%); min_payout (10,000); payout_day (Tue); scope (poker).
	•	Formulas: Rakeback = Qualifying Weekly Rake/Turnover x rakeback_percentage.

6.6 Arcade Cashback 5%
	•	Admin inputs: cashback_percentage (5%); min_payout (50,000); max_payout (10,000,000); calc_window (Mon–Sun); payout_day (Mon after 14:00); scope (arcade).
	•	Formulas: Cashback = clamp(Weekly Turnover x cashback_percentage, min_payout, max_payout).

6.7 Casino Weekly Commission
	•	Admin inputs: commission_percentage (0.5%); calc_window (Mon–Sun); payout_day (Mon); scope (casino only); stackable flag (usually false).
	•	Formulas: Bonus = Weekly Casino Turnover x commission_percentage.

6.8 Free Balance Bonus (Loss Guarantee)
	•	Admin inputs: min_deposit (bank only); max_guarantee (configurable cap); claim_to_multiplier (e.g., 2x deposit); withdraw_multiplier (e.g., 4x (deposit + guarantee)); max_withdrawable; allowed_providers (Pragmatic Play, PG Soft); first_deposit_only flag; requires_preplay_contact flag.
	•	Formulas: Guarantee = min(loss, max_guarantee) after meeting TO. Claim TO requirement = deposit x claim_to_multiplier. Withdrawal gate = (deposit + guarantee) x withdraw_multiplier; withdrawals capped at max_withdrawable.

6.9 Sabung Ayam Cashback 5% (SV388)
	•	Admin inputs: cashback_percentage (5%); min_payout (25,000); payout_day (Tue); scope (sabung/SV388); max_payout (none).
	•	Formulas: Cashback = max(Weekly Turnover x cashback_percentage, min_payout); no cap.